UnitVotingEscrow::TokenByIndex
├── when the enumeration is empty
│   └── it should revert with ERC721OutOfBoundsIndex
└── given the enumeration holds tokens
    ├── when the index is within the enumeration
    │   └── it should return the token id at that index
    ├── when using a known unordered example
    │   └── it should return the token id at that index
    └── when the index equals the total supply
        └── it should revert with ERC721OutOfBoundsIndex
